<p>Melding psionics with steamtech you create 5 mind drones at your sides that fly towards your target.</p><p>If they encounter a creature they will latch on it and bore into its skull for 6 turns, disrupting its thoughts.</p><p>Disrupted creatures have <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 23%, 27%, 30%, 32%</acronym> chances to fail to use talents and suffer a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-14%, -40%, -52%, -58%, -61%</acronym> reduction to fear and sleep immunity.</p>